d fear Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing of that within the breasts.","j":6,"h":11,"s":5,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"5:8","t":"O you who have believed, be persistently standing firm for Allāh, witnesses in justice, and do not let the hatred of a people prevent you from being just. Be just; that is nearer to righteousness. And fear Allāh; indeed, Allāh is [fully] Aware of what you do.","j":6,"h":11,"s":5,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"5:9","t":"Allāh has promised those who believe and do righteous deeds [that] for them there is forgiveness and great reward.","j":6,"h":11,"s":5,"a":9,"sd":null}],"juz":6,"hizb":11,"surahs":[5],"sajdah":false}